              "message" : "<p>ALTER TABLE bank_transfers_augmented\nADD CONSTRAINT btaug_pk PRIMARY KEY (txn_id);</p>\n<p>ALTER TABLE bank_transfers_augmented\nADD CONSTRAINT btaug_src_fk\nFOREIGN KEY (src_acct_id) REFERENCES bank_accounts(id);</p>\n<p>ALTER TABLE bank_transfers_augmented\nADD CONSTRAINT btaug_dst_fk\nFOREIGN KEY (dst_acct_id) REFERENCES bank_accounts(id);</p>\n",
